  "description": "Stocks ignored another week of bearish headlines and hit new highs. Here’s what I’m watching as the blow-off top continues.",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Saturday, hope you are enjoying the weekend. The S&amp;P 500 made another all time high this week. This was particularly refreshing because we have had to battle incessant negative news:</p><ul><li><p>Weakening labor market - jobless claims rose from another 9,000 in July</p></li><li><p>Inflation well above the Fed’s target - July CPI was 3.4% YoY</p></li><li><p>Yen carry trade - Bank of Japan considering another rate hike</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LxOz!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa1ce993e-8a42-4341-b8f5-0cddbaf6465c_1425x878.webp\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LxOz!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa1ce993e-8a42-4341-b8f5-0cddbaf6465c_1425x878.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LxOz!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa1ce993e-8a42-4341-b8f5-0cddbaf6465c_1425x878.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LxOz!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa1ce993e-8a42-4341-b8f5-0cddbaf6465c_1425x878.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LxOz!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa1ce993e-8a42-4341-b8f5-0cddbaf6465c_1425x878.webp 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LxOz!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.co